49k|n|The act of approximating; a drawing, advancing or being near; approach; also, the result of approximating. ; An approach to a correct estimate, calculation, or conception, or to a given quantity, quality, etc. ; A continual approach or coming nearer to a result; as, to solve an equation by approximation. ; A value that is nearly but not exactly correct.	a:ijr,77,3;w53,46,11;sli,43,8~w53,46,11;sli,43,8;ijr,77,3
