4ae|n|Fit or fitted; suited; suitable; appropriate. ; Having an habitual tendency; habitually liable or likely; -- used of things. ; Inclined; disposed customarily; given; ready; -- used of persons. ; Ready; especially fitted or qualified (to do something); quick to learn; prompt; expert; as, a pupil apt to learn; an apt scholar.	a:1c22,16,1~1c22,16,1
